	Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\n2 Pauls\, 1 Show: Paul Ollinger & Paul Farahvar
	 LIVE at Cobb’s Comedy Club\nTwo of comedy’s most entertaining voices unit
	e for one unforgettable night! Paul Ollinger and Paul Farahvar bring their
	 unique comedic styles together for a special double-bill show at the lege
	ndary Cobb’s Comedy Club in San Francisco. Whether you know them from thei
	r stand-up specials\, podcasts\, or live performances\, this is a night of
	 laughs you won’t want to miss. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 23\
	, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Cl
	ub\nAddress: 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\nAge Requireme
	nt: 18+ (Valid photo ID required)\nBeverage Minimum: Two-drink minimum per
	 person \nAbout Paul Ollinger & Paul Farahvar\nPaul Ollinger is a stand-up
	 comedian and former Facebook VP who brings a sharp\, self-deprecating wit
	 to his performances\, blending corporate satire with personal storytellin
	g. Paul Farahvar is a Bay Area comedian known for his clever observations 
	and high-energy delivery. Together\, they make for a dynamic and hilarious
	 evening of comedy that appeals to a wide range of audiences. \nWhat to Ex
	pect\n\nA special double-bill featuring two talented comedians in one show
	\nSharp\, observational humor from both Paul Ollinger and Paul Farahvar\nA
	n intimate club atmosphere at the iconic Cobb’s Comedy Club\nDoors open on
	e hour before showtime — arrive early for the best seats\nFull bar service
	 with a two-drink minimum per person\nA fun Thursday night out in San Fran
	cisco’s North Beach neighborhood\n\nVenue Information\nCobb’s Comedy Club 
	is one of San Francisco’s most beloved comedy venues\, located at 915 Colu
	mbus Avenue in the heart of North Beach. The club has hosted legendary com
	edians for decades and offers an intimate\, welcoming atmosphere perfect f
	or an evening of live comedy. Street parking is available nearby\, and the
