	first-come\, first-served)\nMinimum: 2-item food/drink minimum per person 
	\nAbout Jess Hilarious\nJess Hilarious is a comedian\, actress\, and media
	 personality best known for her viral social media presence and her role o
	n Wild ‘N Out. She has appeared on The Breakfast Club and numerous comedy 
	specials\, building a massive fanbase with her unfiltered\, high-energy co
	medic style. Her stand-up shows are known for being raw\, relatable\, and 
	absolutely hilarious. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up from one of
	 comedy’s hottest rising stars\nUnfiltered\, relatable humor that keeps th
	e crowd roaring\nIntimate comedy club atmosphere at Chicago Improv\nFull f
	ood and drink service (2-item minimum)\n21+ event — valid photo ID require
	d\nGeneral admission seating — arrive early for best seats\n\nVenue Inform
	ation\nChicago Improv is located inside Woodfield Mall in Schaumburg\, IL\
	, one of the premier comedy clubs in the Chicago area. The venue offers a 
