	o Event Center\nAddress: 2920 East R Street\, Tacoma\, WA 98404\nAge Requi
	rement:\nParking: Ample parking available in multiple garages at EQC Tacom
	a \nAbout Jeff Dunham\nJeff Dunham is one of the most successful stand-up 
	comedians in the world\, known for his unique blend of ventriloquism and c
	omedy. His beloved characters — including Walter\, Peanut\, Achmed the Dea
	d Terrorist\, and Bubba J — have made him a household name. Dunham holds t
	he Guinness World Record for the most tickets sold for a stand-up comedy t
	our and has sold out arenas across the globe. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilariou
