SUMMARY:Thank You Miami Stand Up Comedy Show (Friday)
DTSTAMP:20260723T104920Z
DTSTART:20260724T210000Z
DESCRIPTION:Kick off Friday right: craft beers on tap\, late-night bites & 
	Miami‘s funniest comics. Laugh\, sip & start your weekend like a local leg
	end.\n\n\n\n\nYou Can’t Go Wrong On A Friday Night By Doing Something Diff
	erent.\nLaughs. \nCraft Beers. \nAnd a dining menu that satisfies the munc
	hies: https://thankyoumiami.godaddysites.com/menu \nSkip the lines at nigh
	tclubs and the overpriced cocktails — start your weekend with a local come
	dy night that’s pure Miami. \nTickets & Seating \n🎟 First Come\, First Ser
	ve \n\nFree entry\nSeating not guaranteed — show up early for the good spo
	ts\n\n🍻 Guaranteed Preferred Seating + BOGO Drinks — $25 \n\nGuaranteed ma
	in-area seating during showtime\nBuy-One-Get-One-Free drinks\n\n👕 Guarante
	ed Preferred Seating + BOGO Drinks + T-Shirt — $35 \n\nEverything above\, 
	plus a limited-edition Miami Comedy T-shirt. Look like you’ve been here si
	nce day one\, even if it’s your first Friday.\n\n(Because space is limited
	\, seated guests are asked to order at least one drink or menu item. Easy.
	) \n\n\nLooking for a Promo Code? \nText “MIAMI” to (786) 610-5571 \n\n\n\
	nCelebrate 10 Years of Laughter with the Miami Comedy Anniversary Shirt!\n
	Celebrate a decade of laughs with the Miami Comedy 10-Year Anniversary Shi
	rt! This exclusive\, limited-edition design marks a milestone in our journ
	ey of bringing joy to Miami. Every purchase supports the Miami Comedy comm
	unity\, helping us grow and continue spreading laughter across the city. \
	nThis collectible shirt is one-of-a-kind—once it’s sold out\, it’s gone fo
	rever. Don’t miss your chance to own a stylish piece of Miami comedy histo
	ry and be part of something truly special. Grab yours now and celebrate 10
	 years of laughs with us! \nSizes S – XL available. \n\n\nMedia\n\nWatch a
	ll our videos about Thank You Miami Comedy Night: https://youtube.com/play
	list?list=PLWygUR7TT1rBo8XBgJ9aP2M4ZkLc8uAbd\nSee all the fun we’re having
	 on this show! Photos available here: https://miamicomedy.com/tag/thank-yo
	u-miami+photography/\n\nAbout Thank You Miami Beer House and Cocina.\nThan
	k You Miami Beer House and Cocina is the newest hip bar located in Flagler
	 and 17th. This bar gives thanks to the city by offering a large selection
	 of beers and food as well as LIVE entertainment. \n\n\n\nAbout Miami Come
	dy\nMiamiComedy.com has produced independent comedy events for years. Over
	 time we’ve built a platform where you can laugh everyday in Miami! We pre
	sent to you authentic local and national performers and curate entertainin
	g live shows for locals who love to laugh and enjoy the true art of stand 
	up comedy. As seen on Amazon Prime Video “Respect the Light” the Miami New
	 Times\, Culture Crusaders\, the Miami Improv and UNATION. We create unfor
	gettably funny pop up shows all over the Magic City\, in all your favorite
	 bars\, restaurants\, lounges\, theaters and virtual! We make each experie
	nce unique with its own environment\, line up\, drinking\, social groups a
	nd dining menus! \nQuestions? Special Occasions? Event Planning? Birthdays
	?\nGet in contact with me here: \nText: 786-610-5571 \nEmail: manny@miamic
	omedy.com \nChat: miamicomedy.com\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/than
	k-you-miami-stand-up-comedy-show-friday-45/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/thank-you-miami-stand-up-comedy-show-f
	riday-45/
LOCATION:Thank You Miami Cocina & Beer House\, 1701 West Flagler Street\, #
	Suite 101\, Miami\, FL\, 33135\, United States
